Suppose $u(x, y)$ is a harmonic function on a domain $D$ and $v(x, y)$ is a harmonic conjugate of $u$. Which of the following is a harmonic conjugate of $v$?

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$-u$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$u$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$1 / u$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$-v$

